From: ra80v2-nss project
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: add ipq5018-xiaomi-ax3000-v2.dtb to Makefile

Register ipq5018-xiaomi-ax3000-v2.dtb in arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile.

Signed-off-by: ra80v2-nss
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -20,2 +20,3 @@ dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5018-rdp432-c2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5018-tplink-archer-ax55-v1.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5018-xiaomi-ax3000-v2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= ipq5332-rdp441.dtb
